  "details": "Hello, I got ~10 disconnects for last 5min and other people too. I am not sure it is bug in client, or some people use exploits in the game. \n\nI understand that you VRChat a small team, but make some work on security side, because as I know your client code of app only partially obfuscated - so anyone can lear it and make exploits. Why??\n\nIn last updates, you works on safety mode, but it is not solve problem, because crashers do not use effects to crash someone.\n\nAlso few days ago i had same problem in VRChat. Fix it please!",
